@@ -3,3 +3,8 @@
 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## JSON Pointer
+
+`resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves an RFC 6901 JSON Pointer and returns its referenced
+value. It throws when the pointer is malformed or does not identify a value in the document.
diff --git a/docs/memory/decision-log/dl-001-use-strict-rfc-6901-pointer-evaluation.md b/docs/memory/decision-log/dl-001-use-strict-rfc-6901-pointer-evaluation.md
