+id: task-001-implement-rfc-6901-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` in `src/index.ts`.
+
+The resolver follows RFC 6901 token decoding, supports the root pointer, object members and array
+indices, and rejects malformed pointers and unresolved paths. Added deterministic tests for normal,
+escaped, null-valued, malformed and missing references. The public API is documented in the README.
